          Komorebi.PaperII.NestedRefinement.Refines Q (Komorebi.PaperII.CommonRefinement.common P Q h) fun k ↦ (↑k).2 :=
fun {R} {M} [Semiring R] [AddCommMonoid M] [_root_.Module R M] {ι} {κ} [Fintype ι] [Fintype κ] P Q h hp hq ↦
  ⟨Komorebi.PaperII.CommonRefinement.supported_nonzero (Komorebi.PaperII.CommonRefinement.product P Q h),
